{"resource": {"name": "SimCon Second Division", "id": "k9q4-996x", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;font-size:12pt\"><P><SPAN>\"SimCon Second Division\" is short for \"Simultaneous Conveyance Second Division\". It is part of a set of data called \"Land Division - All\". Please read through all of the following to fully understand what this data is. A conveyance is the transfering of legal title of property from person(s) or entity to another. A \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" is the transfer of multiple properties using a single survey document. Examples of this are plats, short plats, condiminiums, etc. The \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" data contains the current aggregated highest-level formal land divisions (plats, short plats, large lots, etc). Meaning that the most recent \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" type is what is represented in this data. In other words, there are no overlapping \"Simultaneous Conveyances\" in this data, a newer \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" erases what was present before at that location. There are two data sets related to the \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" data: \"SimCon First Division\" and \"SimCon Second Division\". \"SimCon First Division\" contains the next level down of polygons within the \"Simultaneous Conveyance\". For example a plat that contained blocks and lots would only have its blocks in this data. A plat that contained lots and no blocks would have its lots in this data. \"SimCon Second Division\" contains the next level down of polygons within the \"SimCon First Division\" data. For example a plat that contained blocks and lots would have its lots in this data.</SPAN></P></DIV>", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-06-25T09:28:55.000Z", "createdAt": "2022-02-14T22:26:23.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-02-14T22:26:25.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-06-25T09:28:55.000Z", "columns_name": ["ConveyanceType", "Shape__Length", "Shape__Area", "EditDate", "AuditorFeeNumber", "ATRPlatNumber", "ConveyanceDate", "ConveyanceName", "SecondDivisionDesignator", "FirstDivisionDesignator", "OBJECTID", "ConveyanceComment", "SecondDivisionType", "FirstDivisionType", "the_geom"], "columns_field_name": ["conveyancetype", "shape_length", "shape_area", "editdate", "auditorfeenumber", "atrplatnumber", "conveyancedate", "conveyancename", "seconddivisiondesignator", "firstdivisiondesignator", "objectid", "conveyancecomment", "seconddivisiontype", "firstdivisiontype", "the_geom"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Number", "Number", "Date", "Text", "Text", "Date", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "MultiPolygon"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2022-02-14T22:26:25.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_tags": [], "domain_metadata": []}, "metadata": {"domain": "open.piercecountywa.gov"}, "permalink": "https://open.piercecountywa.gov/d/k9q4-996x", "link": "https://open.piercecountywa.gov/dataset/SimCon-Second-Division/k9q4-996x", "owner": {"id": "b87i-kis6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "BrandyRiche"}, "creator": {"id": "b87i-kis6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "BrandyRiche"}}
{"resource": {"name": "SimCon First Division", "id": "kukj-pr8b", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;font-size:12pt\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN>\"SimCon First Division\" is short for \"Simultaneous Conveyance First Division\". It is part of a set of data called \"Land Division - All\". Please read through all of the following to fully understand what this data is. A conveyance is the transferring of legal title of property from person(s) or entity to another. A \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" is the transfer of multiple properties using a single survey document. Examples of this are plats, short plats, condominiums, etc. The \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" data contains the current aggregated highest-level formal land divisions (plats, short plats, large lots, etc). Meaning that the most recent \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" type is what is represented in this data. In other words, there are no overlapping \"Simultaneous Conveyances\" in this data, a newer \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" erases what was present before at that location. There are two data sets related to the \"Simultaneous Conveyance\" data: \"SimCon First Division\" and \"SimCon Second Division\". \"SimCon First Division\" contains the next level down of polygons within the \"Simultaneous Conveyance\". For example a plat that contained blocks and lots would only have its blocks in this data. A plat that contained lots and no blocks would have its lots in this data. \"SimCon Second Division\" contains the next level down of polygons within the \"SimCon First Division\" data. For example a plat that contained blocks and lots would have its lots in this data.  Please read metadata (https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/GISmetadata/SimultaneousConveyance.html) for additional information. Any data download constitutes acceptance of the Terms of Use. (https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/Disclaimer/PierceCountyGISDataTermsofUse.pdf). Please see provided hyperlinks for metadata and Terms of Use.</SPAN></P></DIV></DIV></DIV>", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-06-25T11:08:09.000Z", "createdAt": "2022-02-14T22:38:58.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-02-14T22:39:16.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-06-25T11:08:09.000Z", "columns_name": ["FirstDivisionType", "the_geom", "OBJECTID", "FirstDivisionDesignator", "ConveyanceType", "ATRPlatNumber", "EditDate", "ConveyanceName", "ConveyanceDate", "AuditorFeeNumber", "ConveyanceComment", "Shape__Area", "Shape__Length"], "columns_field_name": ["firstdivisiontype", "the_geom", "objectid", "firstdivisiondesignator", "conveyancetype", "atrplatnumber", "editdate", "conveyancename", "conveyancedate", "auditorfeenumber", "conveyancecomment", "shape_area", "shape_length"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "MultiPolygon", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Date", "Text", "Date", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Number"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2022-02-14T22:39:16.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_tags": [], "domain_metadata": []}, "metadata": {"domain": "open.piercecountywa.gov"}, "permalink": "https://open.piercecountywa.gov/d/kukj-pr8b", "link": "https://open.piercecountywa.gov/dataset/SimCon-First-Division/kukj-pr8b", "owner": {"id": "b87i-kis6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "BrandyRiche"}, "creator": {"id": "b87i-kis6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "BrandyRiche"}}
{"resource": {"name": "2020 Census Block Groups", "id": "miv7-23ju", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "2020 Census Block Group polygons (have the same first digit of their four-digit identifiers within a census tract) for all of Pierce County, realigned to Pierce County roads, parcels, hydro, railroads, power lines, etc. Population figures for race, ethnicity, median age, household size, household count, etc were downloaded from the US Census website and joined to this layer. Please read metadata for additional information (https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/GISmetadata/pdbis_census2020_block_groups.html). Any data download constitutes acceptance of the Terms of Use (https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/Disclaimer/PierceCountyGISDataTermsofUse.pdf).", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-09-14T00:38:01.000Z", "createdAt": "2022-02-23T22:15:00.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-09-14T00:38:01.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-02-23T22:15:09.000Z", "columns_name": ["HousingVacant", "Shape__Length", "the_geom", "BLKGRPCE20", "HousingCount", "RaceWhite", "HousingOccupied", "OBJECTID", "RaceMixed", "COUNTYFP20", "RaceAfricanAmerican", "TRACTCE20", "RaceAsian", "PopulationTotal", "GEOID20", "RaceOther", "RacePacificIslander", "RaceNativeAmerican", "BLKGRP", "Shape__Area", "NAMELSAD20", "STATEFP20"], "columns_field_name": ["housingvacant", "shape_length", "the_geom", "blkgrpce20", "housingcount", "racewhite", "housingoccupied", "objectid", "racemixed", "countyfp20", "raceafricanamerican", "tractce20", "raceasian", "populationtotal", "geoid20", "raceother", "racepacificislander", "racenativeamerican", "blkgrp", "shape_area", "namelsad20", "statefp20"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Number", "MultiPolygon", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Number", "Number", "Number", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Text"], "columns_description": ["