{"resource": {"name": "Election Precincts (2012-2021) (h)", "id": "mkee-5i3p", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN><SPAN>This data represents Pierce County election precincts which are comprised of voters who share the same district inventory. It is updated based on the redistricting process and is created from the 2010 Census data which was provided by the Washington State Redistricting Commission, who received the data from the U.S. Bureau of the Census.</SPAN></SPAN></P><P><SPAN /></P></DIV></DIV></DIV>", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-07-23T01:05:14.000Z", "createdAt": "2022-07-23T01:05:06.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-07-23T01:05:07.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-07-23T01:05:14.000Z", "columns_name": ["OBJECTID", "the_geom", "PRECINCT", "NAME", "LEGDIST", "CONGDIST", "CCDIST", "Shape__Area", "Shape__Length"], "columns_field_name": ["objectid", "the_geom", "precinct", "name", "legdist", "congdist", "ccdist", "shape_area", "shape_length"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "MultiPolygon", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Number"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2022-07-23T01:05:07.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_tags": [], "domain_metadata": []}, "metadata": {"domain": "open.piercecountywa.gov"}, "permalink": "https://open.piercecountywa.gov/d/mkee-5i3p", "link": "https://open.piercecountywa.gov/dataset/Election-Precincts-2012-2021-h-/mkee-5i3p", "owner": {"id": "b87i-kis6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "BrandyRiche"}, "creator": {"id": "b87i-kis6", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "BrandyRiche"}}
{"resource": {"name": "Sheriff Patrol Districts", "id": "mpg9-kqe7", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;font-size:12pt\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN>This theme shows the Law Districts only in unincorporated Pierce County. It was created to be used by SouthSound911 (SS911) to identify and display different Law Districts and their boundaries. This feature class is registered to the SS911 CAD system, ortho-based roads and shifted annexations. Law Districts are created by dissolving Law ESZ's by District. Please read metadata (</SPAN><A href=\"https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/GISmetadata/pdblesa_patrol_districts.html\" STYLE=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><SPAN>https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/GISmetadata/pdblesa_patrol_districts.html</SPAN></A><SPAN>) for additional information.  Any data download constitutes acceptance of the Terms of Use (</SPAN><A href=\"https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/Disclaimer/PierceCountyGISDataTermsofUse.pdf\" STYLE=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><SPAN>https://matterhorn.co.pierce.wa.us/Disclaimer/PierceCountyGISDataTermsofUse.pdf</SPAN></A><SPAN>).  Additional SS911 Terms of Use found in the metadata.</SPAN></P></DIV></DIV></DIV>", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2022-06-08T22:49:28.000Z", "createdAt": "2022-06-08T22:49:23.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-06-08T22:49:24.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2022-06-08T22:49:28.000Z", "columns_name": ["Shape__Area", "Shape__Length", "the_geom", "DISTRICT", "OBJECTID"], "columns_field_name": ["shape_area", "shape_length", "the_geom", "district", "objectid"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Number", "MultiPolygon", "Text", "Number"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2022-06-08T22:49:24.000Z"}, "classi